  "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Renauld Sunglasses design, manufacture and sell High-End Luxury sunglasses based on the original Renauld sunglasses from the 1960&rsquo;s. Renauld is the &lsquo;Rolex of Sunglasses making unique and highly exclusive sunglasses.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Renauld Sunglasses have a rich heritage and have been worn by many famous people such as Elvis, Jim Clark, James Garner, Jackie Onassis and The Rolling Stones. Today these provide a very strong 3 third party reference as influencers from the past. Renauld sunglasses have come from and are active in three main categories which are Music, Fashion and Automotive.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Today&rsquo;s wearers include Kendal Jenner, Dolly Parton, Natasha Bassett, Paris Jackson and Madeleine Baily amongst many others. Renauld have recently collaborated with Triumph Motorcycles, The Indy 500 and Classic Team Lotus with the Jim Clark Trust on brand specific Sixty-One models.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Our Sunglasses are hand crafted in Italy from the highest quality materials and plated in 24ct Gold or Palladium. The lenses are supplied from the world renown manufacturer Divel and offer UV 400 Performance guaranteeing 100% UVA and UVB protection. Renauld make very limited edition models and numbers normally not more than 200 per season.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Our styles are unique and protected under US patents. They include the &lsquo;Rossano&rsquo; , made famous in the opening sequence of the Italian Job, the &lsquo;Sixty-One&rsquo; worn throughout the sixties by Elvis, Jackie Onassis, Sean Connery and David Niven and the Bikini which is unique and not changed since its introduction in 1963.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">We pay our affiliates on a 30 day period from the date of sale.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Our Instagram <a style=\"color: rgb(5, 99, 193); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/renauldsunglasses/\">https://www.instagram.com/renauldsunglasses/</a> provides an up to date view of current wearers and events.</p>",
